      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The caregiver repeatedly expressed reluctance to make another hospital trip due to the patient’s fatigue and fear of bleeding. The model offered a feasible, time‑bounded triage‑desk route and a fallback plan that maintained emergency thresholds.",
